<h1>Safety Information</h1>

<p>Your safety is our top priority. We are committed to creating a secure environment for both guests and hosts.</p>

<h3>For Guests</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Review host profiles and ratings before booking.</li>
    <li>Use secure in-platform payments only.</li>
    <li>Read house rules carefully.</li>
    <li>Report suspicious behavior immediately.</li>
</ul>

<h3>For Hosts</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Verify guest profiles before accepting bookings.</li>
    <li>Communicate clearly through the platform.</li>
    <li>Keep emergency contact information accessible.</li>
    <li>Install smoke detectors and safety equipment.</li>
</ul>

<p>If you experience any issue, please contact our support team immediately.</p>

